; What a plain `dune build` builds: everything but the predicate viewer
; (tools/predicate-viewer/, alias predicate-viewer) and the JSON prints it
; reads (tools/prints/). Without this alias, the default of the root would
; build every target of the project, including those. A new top-level
; directory with rules goes in the list.

(alias
 (name default)
 (deps
  (alias_rec theories/default)
  (alias_rec machine_utils/default)
  (alias_rec tools/default)))
